***Employment Earnings***
*wave 9 respondent earnings from main job after tax
gen r`wavenum'itmain = .
replace r`wavenum'itmain = .m if mi(thp_r_i) & inw`wavenum'==1 
replace r`wavenum'itmain = thp_r_i*52 if !mi(thp_r_i)

