label variable s`wavenum'wretage "s`wavenum'wretage:w`wavenum' age S wants to retire"

***compulsory retirement age***
*wave 6 respondent compulsory retirement age
gen r`wavenum'cretage = .
replace r`wavenum'cretage = .m if WPCRAge==-1
replace r`wavenum'cretage = .d if WPCRAge==-8 | WPCRet==-8 | WpEs==-8
replace r`wavenum'cretage = .r if WPCRAge==-9 | WPCRet==-9 | WpEs==-9
replace r`wavenum'cretage = .e if inlist(WPActW,3,4) 
